    "**Built:** dated staff notes / comments feed on the client profile (internal, not customer-visible).",
    "",
    "**Model:** `Client.Notes: List<ClientNote>` subdocument array `{ id, text, authorId, authorName, createdAt(UTC) }` — schemaless, no migration. Targeted `$push`/`$pull` only (never a full doc replace).",
