    "",
    "**Builds:** dotnet `SoulPilates.API` Release = 0 errors; Astro `npm ci && npm run build` = success (throwaway --rm containers, no deploy image / no restart).",
    "",
    "**Branch:** `feature/client-notes` (off `origin/deploy/sp-ideas-live`, so a SUPERSET incl. the 5 Ideas features) — tip `69c3970`, pushed to origin.",
    "",
    "**Deploy:** `cd /opt/soulpilates && git fetch origin && git checkout -B main origin/feature/client-notes && scripts/deploy-prod.sh`",
    "",
    "**Model:** claude-opus-4-8.",
  ].join("\n"),
}});
console.log(JSON.stringify({ cardId:card.id, position, commentId:comment.id }, null, 2));
await prisma.$disconnect();
EOF
